OL,3,GNEWSAVirtual queue for disabled at
OL,4,AAlton Towers praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new virtual queuing system for
OL,7,Fvisitors with accessibility needs to be
OL,8,Fintroduced first at Alton Towers has
OL,9,Fbeen praised by charities.
OL,11,FThe upgraded ride access pass (Rap), to
OL,12,Fbe in use later at other Merlin-run
OL,13,Fparks like Thorpe Park and Legoland
OL,14,FWindsor Resort, enables queuing for
OL,15,Frides via an app rather than in
OL,16,Fphysical lines.
OL,18,FThe news follows a backlash in February
OL,19,Fwhen proposed changes led to visitors
OL,20,Fwith conditions such as ADHD and autism
OL,21,Fbeing told they would not be able to
OL,22,Fuse a physical Rap.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
