OL,3,GNEWSAVirtual queue for disabled at
OL,4,AAlton Towers praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will be no change to the
OL,7,Feligibility criteria for the pass,
OL,8,Favailable to those who have problems
OL,9,Fqueuing for long periods because of a
OL,10,Fphysical, emotional or learning need,
OL,11,FMerlin says.
